snapshot-boot (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * 60-snapshot-theme.cfg: append quiet and splash to
    GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT only when missing instead of overwriting it.
    The fixed value discarded the resume= (and any other) parameters that
    the installer writes to /etc/default/grub, which grub-mkconfig sources
    before this file.
  * GRUB theme: name the font "GNU Unifont Regular 16", the face name of
    trixie's unicode.pf2. "Unifont Regular 16" matched no loaded font, so
    GRUB fell back to the first one it had.

 -- Blackbird Cyber <snapshot@example.invalid>  Thu, 01 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

